<title>SOUTH AFRICA: CRICKET-SOUTH AFRICA V INDIA TOSS/TEAMS.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-SOUTH AFRICA V INDIA TOSS/TEAMS.</headline>
<dateline>EAST LONDON, South Africa 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>India won the</p>
<p>toss and chose to bat in the triangular series day/night match</p>
<p>against South Africa on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Teams:</p>
<p>South Africa - Gary Kirsten, Adam Bacher, Jacques Kallis,</p>
<p>Daryll Cullinan, Jonty Rhodes, Hansie Cronje (captain), Shaun</p>
<p>Pollock, Dave Richardson, Lance Klusener, Allan Donald, Paul</p>
<p>Adams.</p>
<p>India - Rahul Dravid, Saurav Ganguly, Sachin Tendulkar</p>
<p>(captain), Mohammad Azharuddin, Ajay Jadeja, Robin Singh, Saba</p>
<p>Karim, Sunil Joshi, Anil Kumble, Javagal Srinath, Venkatesh</p>
<p>Prasad.</p>
</text>
